  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nAmount after 3 years = ₹5324\n\nAmount after 5 years = ₹6442.04\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nA = P × (1 + r/100)t\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n⇒ A₅ / A₃ = (1 + r/100)⁵ ÷ (1 + r/100)³\n\n⇒ 6442.04 ÷ 5324 = (1 + r/100)²\n\n⇒ 1.21 = (1 + r/100)²\n\n⇒ 1.1 = (1 + r/100)\n\n⇒ r = 10%\n\nNow find Principal:\n\n⇒ 5324 = P × (1.1)³\n\n⇒ 5324 = P × 1.331\n\n⇒ P = 5324 ÷ 1.331\n\n⇒ P = 4000\n\n**∴ Principal = ₹4000**\n\n69:T41",
